      "url": "https://businessbaydevelopments.com/journal/property-title-registration-egypt-green-contract",
      "headline": "Green Contract or Nothing: Understanding Property Title Registration in Egypt",
      "description": "A sales contract and a registered title are not the same thing in Egypt, and the difference decides whether you can get residency, sell, or borrow against your property.",
